  "tutorial": {
    "lessonTitle": {
      "zh-CN": "先读边界，再读数字",
      "en": "Read the border before the number"
    },
    "lessonBody": {
      "zh-CN": "靠近粗国界的数字仍以自己为中心，但范围只保留同色国家里的格子。边界外即使紧挨着，也绝不计数。提示会强框数字、弱框它真正覆盖的范围。",
      "en": "A clue beside a thick border is still centered on itself, but its area keeps only cells in the same colored country. Adjacent cells across the border never count. A hint strongly outlines the clue and softly outlines its true scope."
    },
    "completionTitle": {
      "zh-CN": "边界已经变得清楚",
      "en": "The border now reads clearly"
    },
    "completionBody": {
      "zh-CN": "你已经分别解开国界两侧。最后一张序页会同时出现三个国家，并开放完整的辅助工具。",
      "en": "You solved both sides of a border independently. The final prologue leaf introduces three countries and the full set of assistance tools."
    }
  },
